* text=auto
*.css linguist-vendored
*.scss linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore

# Issue #141: these are real ICPC exports, and the point of them is that they
# arrive the way the ICPC site produces them -- CRLF line endings, and
# latin1.tab in Windows-1252. `* text=auto` above would normalise the CRLF
# away on commit, so after a fresh checkout the parser test named
# "utf8 survives crlf" would be reading LF files and passing without testing
# anything. -text keeps the bytes as committed.
tests/Fixtures/team-import/*.tab -text
tests/Fixtures/team-import/*.tsv -text
tests/Fixtures/team-import/*.txt -text

# Issue #147: as fixtures de importacao de evento sao entrada de parser e os
# testes casam trechos multilinha delas com "\n" literal. `* text=auto` acima
# trocaria as quebras de linha no checkout e o casamento falharia (ou, pior,
# passaria sem testar nada). -text mantem os bytes como foram commitados.
tests/Fixtures/event-import/* -text
